{"id":"n83145-1-4","stage":5,"title":"채다 · 猜到","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83145-1-4-1","ko":"나한테 이렇게 잘해 주는 거 보니까 무슨 부탁을 하려고 하는구나?","zh":"你对我这么好，看来是有什么事情要拜托我吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘해","meaning":"善待","explanation":"잘하다：善待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘해","audio":"/audio/e758d705a95b3659b348.mp3"}},{"text":"주는","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주는","audio":"/audio/f2dcf42e42a4682a9877.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니까","audio":"/audio/da5702f163f863395e8e.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"부탁을","meaning":"拜托，请求，托付","explanation":"부탁：拜托，请求，托付；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부탁","audio":"/audio/941d76ddd357e6c67c2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59301","senseId":"1","lemma":"부탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부탁을","audio":"/audio/84d82e2220bc0c178b9c.mp3"}},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려고","audio":"/audio/761078da9d37d7327667.mp3"}},{"text":"하는구나?","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는구나","audio":"/audio/7bc2d82961f099d6791b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善待","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"亲切、用心地对待。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"941d76ddd357e6c6","term":"부탁","zh":"拜托，请求，托付","audio":"/audio/941d76ddd357e6c67c2e.mp3","entryId":"59301","definition":"请他人做某事或将某事委托给他人。","pronunciation":["부ː탁"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a3c107df62701b56c5a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83145-1-4-2","ko":"벌써 눈치를 챘어?","zh":"你已经察觉到啦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"눈치를","meaning":"眼力，眼力见儿","explanation":"눈치：眼力，眼力见儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈치","audio":"/audio/e2d6245630ee85fa9b86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41644","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈치를","audio":"/audio/699c547070f3aa2391cb.mp3"}},{"text":"챘어?","meaning":"猜到，察觉，看出","explanation":"채다：猜到，察觉，看出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"채다","audio":"/audio/eb20d16d45e88ac08fb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83145","senseId":"1","lemma":"채다","origin":"NIKL Korean-C